     A* ------------------------------------------------------------
     A* CUSMST - Customer master
     A* 1988 created  RKM
     A* 1999 Y2K: dates left as MMDDYY (window 40)  JS
     A* ------------------------------------------------------------
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A          R CUSMSTR                   TEXT('Customer master')
     A            CMCUST         5A         COLHDG('Customer')
     A            CMNAME        40A         COLHDG('Company name')
     A            CMCONT        30A         COLHDG('Contact')
     A            CMTITL        30A         COLHDG('Contact title')
     A            CMADDR        60A         COLHDG('Address')
     A            CMCITY        15A         COLHDG('City')
     A            CMREGN        15A         COLHDG('Region')
     A            CMPOST        10A         COLHDG('Postal code')
     A            CMCNTY        15A         COLHDG('Country')
     A            CMPHON        24A         COLHDG('Phone')
     A            CMFAX         24A         COLHDG('Fax')
     A            CMSTAT         1A         COLHDG('Status D=Deleted')
     A            CMCRDT         6S 0       COLHDG('Created MMDDYY')
     A            CMCHDT         6S 0       COLHDG('Changed MMDDYY')
     A            CMCHUS        10A         COLHDG('Changed by')
     A          K CMCUST
